==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*3 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bannerman Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 2~8.67 seconds<sup>60f~260f</sup>.
**4 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 5.33~8.67 seconds<sup>160f~260f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A relatively easy stage. Bring any [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Ahosan Domain is named after the prefix 阿 ''a'' and 火山 ''kazan'' (volcano). ''Ho'' is one of the ''[[wikipedia:Kanji#Kun'yomi (native reading)|kun]]'' readings of 火, and the stage's name ignores the ''[[wikipedia:Rendaku|rendaku]]'' that normally causes 山 to be read as ''zan'' instead of ''san''.

